      "tokenized_text": "<C:0001,0004,><C:0000,0003,2C65FFFF>Mükemmel<C:0000,0003,000000FF> olmayan her hasar\n<C:0000,0003,2C65FFFF><C:0000,0003,000000FF>boşa sayılır ve düşmanı iyileştirir<C:0000,0003,2C65FFFF><C:0000,0003,000000FF>!<C:0000,0003,2C65FFFF><C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0003,0001,><C:0000,0003,000000FF>",
